WEBVTT

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.400
Hamburger, hamburger, all the way there

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.900
In-N-Out — she chants it forty times

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.400
Then she eats the bun and all the fries

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.100
And hands the meat right back to me

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:26.500
The boy wants whatever he can reach

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.800
He went for the dog's bowl twice this year

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.700
He can't talk yet, but he can find the dinosaurs

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:39.800
It's dinosaurs all day. I never get the screen.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.200
Hamburger, hamburger

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.600
Whatever it is, we don't have it

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.500
Two of them, two of us

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.100
And they're winning

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:01.400
Two iPads. One each. He broke them both.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.400
A thousand dollars to repair one

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.800
The other one I sold online for a hundred fifty

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:14.500
Two kids, one iPad. Work it out.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:18.800
The girl is angry at Kirby again

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:23.200
She throws the controller — sofa, then the wall

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:27.300
Ten minutes later she asks for it back

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:32.260
Kirby doesn't know. Kirby is still smiling.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:36.600
Hamburger, hamburger

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.900
Whatever it is, we don't have it

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.900
Two of them, two of us

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:49.400
And they're winning

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.800
In the car I put on Forgotten Land

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.100
The game she throws the controller at

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:02.300
No lyrics in it. She sings it anyway.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:07.100
Words she made up. Loud. The whole drive.

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:11.500
Hamburger, hamburger

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.900
Whatever it is, we don't have it

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:20.500
Two of them, two of us, twenty-one years

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:25.400
And one of us answers every time
